        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;No restart:&lt;/b&gt; the providers poll every 30 seconds, so a merged change shows within a minute. The Grafana chart's own RBAC is off: with a sidecar enabled, its ClusterRole would let Grafana read every Secret and ConfigMap in the cluster." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
